      "otherRequirements": {"status":"verified","items":["Interviews: not part of the regular admissions process; may be used where mitigating circumstances or an applicant’s background need further consideration","Apply to only one Mathematics course — the same offer applies across the department"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.imperial.ac.uk/study/courses/undergraduate/mathematics-bsc/","label":"Imperial: Mathematics BSc"}],"lastVerified":"2026-10-19","sourceSnippet":"We don't currently use interviews as part of our regular admissions process. … Successful candidates will receive the same offer for any course they apply for within the Department, so you should apply to just one."}
