      "otherQualifications": {"status":"verified","items":["For applicants with a US high-school diploma: five APs at grade 5, taken over a maximum of three years, plus a minimum High School Diploma GPA of 3.7 (A*AA/AAA level); subjects may be specified in an offer","Mathematics requirement met with AP Calculus BC at grade 5","AP Seminar, AP Capstone and AP Research do not count; only one of AP Calculus AB/BC counts"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.lse.ac.uk/study-at-lse/international-students/united-states-of-america","label":"LSE: United States of America (international students)"}],"lastVerified":"2026-10-19","sourceSnippet":"A*AA, AAA Five APs at grade 5, taken over a maximum of three years and a minimum High School Diploma GPA 3.7 (subjects may be specified as part of an offer, see the note below about subject combinations). … Mathematics A*/A Calculus BC grade 5 … AP Seminar, AP Capstone and AP Research don't count towards our AP subject requirement."},
      "otherRequirements": {"status":"verified","items":["Assessment uses the UCAS application: predicted/achieved grades, subjects and subject combinations, personal statement, teacher’s reference and educational circumstances","Some applicants with non-traditional or less well-known qualifications may be asked to sit LSE’s Undergraduate Admissions Assessment (UGAA)"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.lse.ac.uk/study-at-lse/undergraduate/bsc-politics-and-economics","label":"LSE: BSc Politics and Economics"},{"url":"https://www.lse.ac.uk/study-at-lse/Undergraduate/Prospective-Students/How-to-Apply/Entry-Requirements","label":"LSE: Undergraduate entry requirements"}],"lastVerified":"2026-10-19","sourceSnippet":["We consider each application carefully, taking into account all the details you’ve included on your UCAS form, such as: … your personal statement your teacher’s reference educational circumstances","Some applicants taking non-traditional qualifications or less well-known qualifications may be required to sit the Undergraduate Admissions Assessment (UGAA) as part of their application to LSE."],"note":"The pages checked do not mention interviews."}
