      "otherRequirements": {"status":"verified","items":["Interview required: top-scoring applicants (by UCAT) are invited to online interviews, anticipated December–February; no offer without attending an interview except in exceptional circumstances","Personal statement is not a weighted part of selection","Minimum age: 18 by 1 September in the year of entry","Offers subject to DBS check, occupational health clearance and MSC Excluded Students Database check","Work experience is not required but strongly encouraged"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.bristol.ac.uk/study/media/undergraduate/admissions-statements/2027/medicine.pdf","label":"Bristol: Admissions Statement 2027 – Medicine"}],"lastVerified":"2026-10-19","sourceSnippet":"Online interviews will form part of the selection criteria for Medicine for the 2026/27 admissions cycle and all applicants who are selected for interview must attend in order to be considered. … We no longer use the personal statement as a weighted component of our selection criteria. … Students must be at least 18 years of age by the 1st of September in their year of entry … While not a requirement for the course, we strongly encourage applicants to obtain some work experience"}
