      "subjectPrerequisites": {"status":"partial","items":["Not used in Altiora’s matching yet — see the note for the official guidance"],"codes":[],"sources":[{"url":"https://admissions.cornell.edu/first-year-sc-johnson-college-applicants","label":"Cornell: First-Year SC Johnson College Applicants"}],"lastVerified":"2026-10-19","sourceSnippet":"Applicants to the Dyson School must have at least 16 total units of high school coursework, including: … 4 units of English … 4 units of mathematics … Calculus is required if offered at your school. … Advanced mathematics in grade 12 is preferred to AP Statistics. … 3 units of science … 1 unit of Chemistry is required. … 1 unit of Biology is required. … An additional unit of science is recommended.","note":"Official: Dyson School (SC Johnson College of Business) applicants must have at least 16 total units of high school coursework, including 4 units of English; 4 units of mathematics (calculus required if offered at your school; advanced mathematics in grade 12 preferred to AP Statistics); 3 units of science including 1 unit of chemistry and 1 unit of biology (both required), an additional unit of science recommended.","reviewFlag":"Official source lists required high-school courses for the Dyson School (16 units incl. English 4, maths 4 with calculus if offered, science 3 incl. chemistry and biology); data/courseRequirements.js holds none. Owner decision."},
