      "ib": {"status":"partial","accepted":"unknown","detail":"Vanderbilt recommends taking IB (or AP/honours) courses where the school offers them, as appropriate.","sources":[{"url":"https://admissions.vanderbilt.edu/apply/expert-advice/","label":"Vanderbilt: Expert Advice"}],"lastVerified":"2026-10-19","sourceSnippet":"If your high school offers advanced, honors, Advanced Placement, or International Baccalaureate courses it's recommended you pursue those as appropriate.","note":"Vanderbilt’s admissions pages say nothing about IB Diploma scores or predicted IB grades in admission; the IB 6/7 statement on the FAQ is about college credit after enrolling, not admission."},
